  "b6_reason": "With XL = 5 ohm and R = 10 ohm the impedance is 5*sqrt(5) ohm; the 10/pi uF capacitor gives Xc = 1000 ohm, which cannot be in series with R and L or no option would fit.",
  "b6_working": "XL = 2*pi*50*(50/pi)e-3 = 5 ohm. Xc = 1/(2*pi*50*(10/pi)e-6) = 1000 ohm. Series would give Z = sqrt(10^2 + 995^2), absurd; taking the C branch as parallel/negligible, Z = sqrt(10^2 + 5^2) = 5*sqrt(5) = 11.18 ohm.",
